  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Biodiversity conservation and sustainable cattle production: using certification schemes to..promote good practices</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project will increase environmentally friendly livestock systems in the Volcanica Central Talamanca Biological Corridor by building capacity of local farmers in best practices, engaging cattle ranchers and students in biodiversity conservation through bird monitoring activities as a conservation indicator in productive landscapes, supporting the environmental livestock production group to produce dissemination materials, and constructing a baseline for an index to evaluate the conservation value of cattle farms in multifunctional landscapes.</narrative>
  </description>
